{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ab686b515a71e92723571dab53ef363dbb8e8c1d6fb8f9299d74e13147e6ecfb","ja":"太陽の宿命","zh":"太阳的宿命","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"026c0aab822a78360fe91d2c292b7d96f21be4d51d28091e689b4886afd6bdd0","ja":"ふぅ……まさか、あんなに人が集まってくるなんて\n思わなかったわね。","zh":"呼……真没想到\n会聚拢来那么多人呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d5a3c9358e502bd2e9dd266dc8800bbedc4b551ed45f90c3a596d5c884d227d6","ja":"ふっ……これも、太陽のように輝いてしまう\n真美たちの宿命ってヤツだよ……。","zh":"呵……这也是像太阳一样耀眼的\n真美她们的宿命啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"79067d43f888c6ce20b6bea0e1ce3d54a8e8e7fc511392a8a1e172cb80e08928","ja":"でも、このままだとスイーツ食べに行けないよ～。\nうまく隠れる方法ないかな～……？","zh":"但是，再这样下去就没法去吃甜点啦～。\n就没有什么能巧妙藏起来的办法吗～……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"59f00cdbaaf8d6191d2c457ab2dd5acc9c5ed3828efde8ed602d0580e58f9e77","ja":"それなら任せておきなさい。\n出前なら、ここでも甘いものが食べられるわ！","zh":"那就包在我身上吧。\n叫外卖的话，在这里也能吃到甜点哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"49633f90b8f01ee4dda9cd2d96b70fc6840e2403b83b369b47763409d202e1f5","ja":"出前スイーツのお店はピックアップ済みよ。\nほら、これを見て。","zh":"可以外送甜点的店家我已经挑选好了。\n你看，看这个。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"be95f0e24bc003ef5bad4b6b0232ffbc2b18f308f82186b82f34f7ce0a71e2d7","ja":"あはっ、美味しそうなスイーツがいっぱいなの☆\nさすが律子、さん、だね♪","zh":"啊哈，好多看起来好好吃的甜点呀☆\n真不愧是律子、姐、呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"cf5a4782b4211d75fce1a953dc852763c78e41a0d305ab9bd8768de356fce500","ja":"うっうー！　どれがいいか迷っちゃいますね♪","zh":"呜——！真纠结该选哪个好呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"fbb3c98f6e9ddef8cd83ee17c8cf16dd2b57840592f1b4a6a35d3decb835d6ec","ja":"あ、でも、配達料がかかるんですね……。","zh":"啊，不过，还要收配送费呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"dcae74ed48aa62894f9f371702412b88d4053359de2a77d2447e61c0b685dc81","ja":"まあ、そればっかりは仕方ないわね。","zh":"哎，唯独那件事也是没办法的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"cd45357e80263d1a3c3c9634f6df35029d273d57c60af8ef7c88da8346acfefe","ja":"太陽は目立ってしまうものだもの。\n私たちの宿命だと思って諦めましょ。","zh":"太阳本就会引人注目嘛。\n就当作是我们的宿命，认了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"5902b31993e567f3c6cde590a9dd1adf7564d8c8586bd71053305c3f29c4e611","ja":"そうそう。それに出前なら、\nいろんなお店のスイーツが選び放題だかんね♪","zh":"没错没错。而且叫外卖的话，\n各种各样店里的甜品都能随便挑呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"d1e68bedffbea44ab09247a6fd7297828733690b2c681d164cfc359e15f4996d","ja":"じゃあ真美は、このお店のショートケーキに、\nモンブランに、あとこっちのお店のアップルパイ……♪","zh":"那真美就要这家店的草莓蛋糕、\n蒙布朗，还有这家店的苹果派……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"e4f9300d7fefb575b5fbbd443609df1f568807ad65268167f559bdf3643ad017","ja":"配達料がかかるって言ってるでしょ！\nお店は1軒だけ、スイーツもひとり1つだけよ！","zh":"都说了要收配送费的吧！\n店铺只能选1家，甜点也是每人只能选1样哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1376.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"dc11f5b9e3371bb3d95cf062064c92ead054675e3a6b04a4e865fd12687a6f99","ja":"うあうあー！　律っちゃんのけち～！！","zh":"哇啊哇啊——！律子小气鬼～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
